            </note>
            <note corresp="#d386-f4" n="12" xml:id="d386-f4-content">
                <p>See memorandum by the Chinese Embassy, November 24, 1947, <ref
                        target="frus1947v07#pg_1223"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>,
                        1947, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">vii</hi>, p. 1223</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
